    <p style="margin-top:14px; max-width:700px; font-size:0.95em;">A comprehensive cross-city analysis of Airbnb listings across New York, London, Paris, Tokyo, Barcelona, Los Angeles, Amsterdam, Bangkok, Rome, and Sydney — examining pricing dynamics, room-type distribution, host concentration, and guest engagement patterns.</p>
