    <div class="fact-box">
        <strong>Regulatory watch:</strong> Cities with high entire-home shares coupled with high professional-host concentration (like <strong>{max_pro_city}</strong>) are most exposed to short-term rental regulations targeting commercial operators. Investors should monitor local policy environments closely in these markets.
