    <div class="chart-container">
        {charts['reviews_per_month']}
    </div>

    <p>Reviews per month serves as the strongest available proxy for booking frequency. <strong>{max_reviews_city}</strong> leads with a mean of <strong>{stats[max_reviews_city]['reviews_pm_mean']:.2f} reviews/month</strong>, suggesting strong and consistent demand. The gap between mean and median review rates across all cities indicates a subset of high-performing listings drive outsized review volumes — likely professionally managed units with optimized pricing and availability.</p>

    <div class="chart-container">
        {charts['review_recency']}
    </div>

    <p>Review recency patterns confirm that the majority of listings with review activity have been reviewed within the past 12 months. <strong>{max(CITIES_ORDER, key=lambda c: stats[c]['review_recent_3m_pct'])}</strong> shows the highest share of recently-reviewed listings ({stats[max(CITIES_ORDER, key=lambda c: stats[c]['review_recent_3m_pct'])]['review_recent_3m_pct']:.1f}% within 3 months), indicating an active and current booking base.</p>

